+- **should-fix** — `engine/cmd/demosrv/main.go:122`: The newly public HTTP server has no `ReadHeaderTimeout`; slow clients can retain backend connections and file descriptors indefinitely. The loopback replay server already sets one. Add equivalent public-server hardening.
