+- **should-fix** `engine/cmd/demosrv/deploy.go:141` — `filepath.Join(".", "serve")` becomes `"serve"`, so `exec.Command` at `engine/cmd/demosrv/main.go:199` searches `$PATH` instead of executing the validated local file. `-nobuild .` can fail late or run an unrelated binary. Return absolute paths or preserve `./`.
