+- **should-fix** `engine/cmd/demosrv/supervisor.go:225` — `startIfIdle` treats any non-nil `s.active` as live without checking `active.done`. If a manual child exits and autostart acquires `mu` before the reaper clears `s.active`, it returns `errAlreadyActive`; `autostartDemo` treats that as terminal and never starts the configured demo. The polling test at `engine/cmd/demosrv/deploy_test.go:349` masks this one-shot race. Check `done` under the lock and clear a dead active entry before refusing.
