+- **blocker** — `engine/cmd/demosrv/deploy.go:40`: a whitespace-only `DEMOSRV_ADMIN_TOKEN` is converted to empty, deliberately opening every mutating endpoint while the server continues. A malformed Secret therefore becomes unauthenticated remote start/stop/control. Fail startup rather than fail open.
