+   content hash, so reproducibility depends on it. Check the shell carefully:
+   unset vs set-empty semantics (`${TYPEMAP-...}` vs `${TYPEMAP:-...}`),
+   word splitting, `set -eu` interaction, the empty-array expansion
+   `"${TYPE_ARGS[@]}"`, and whether the stock-typemap path hashes
+   deterministically. A silent hash collapse here is a blocker.
+
