++  which stays 200 with an idle/crashed engine child. A crashed demo leaves
++  the site idle until an operator restarts (`kubectl rollout restart`).
++  Acceptable while the app is unlaunched; revisit before real traffic.
++- The ManagedCertificate provisions only after DNS points at the LB;
++  `kubectl get managedcertificate -n traffic-sim` should reach Active.
