+**Blocker**
+- PMTiles is not safely content-addressed: its key uses only network bytes, but output also depends on tippecanoe version/flags, minzoom policy, projection, and derived properties. Different tile bytes could collide at one immutable URL; the exact flags are also deferred rather than pinned. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:93` `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:399` `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:410`
+- Region merging has no completeness barrier. If one subscribed region arrives late, emitting the tick without it and re-emitting later cannot work because `SnapshotBuffer.push` drops duplicate ticks. Initial load and pans can therefore permanently omit visible vehicles. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:208` `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:304` `viz/src/snapshots.ts:73`
+- The recording prefix is not content-addressed to recording contents: stream name plus end sequence detects appends, not replacement/different stores with the same metadata. Copied overlays are also output-affecting inputs absent from the digest. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:295` `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:399`
+
+**Should-Fix**
+- Interpolation remains inconsistent: the stated formula yields 625 ms, not 750 ms, and speed-dependent resizing contradicts the promise that `SnapshotBuffer` remains untouched—its `bufferMs` is constructor-fixed and readonly. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:175` `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:304` `viz/src/snapshots.ts:48`
+- Home-tile lane ownership does not support viewport-only TSRL fetching: a visible lane crossing into the viewport may be owned by an unfetched adjacent tile and remain uncolored. Add an ownership halo or visible-region→owner-region mapping. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:237` `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:247`
+- `bake -store -run -out` has no source or binding for the demosrv-global overlay directory, so “copies them when the demo has them” is not implementable from the declared inputs. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:72` `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:295` `engine/cmd/demosrv/main.go:58`
+- The Range deployment contract allows/exposes headers but does not require correct byte-range behavior: `206`, exact requested spans, and `Accept-Ranges: bytes`. CORS alone does not guarantee PMTiles operation. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:414`
+
+**Nit**
+- TSRL cadence is called `strideFrames`, but the manifest field is `laneEveryFrames`; use one contract name. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:243` `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:263`
+
+REVIEW-COMPLETE
