+**Blocker**
+- Region-stall semantics conflict: the completeness barrier forbids emitting tick T until regions cover it, but the shim also emits an empty TSSF while stalled. That consumes T, clears vehicles, and causes the completed frame to be dropped as a duplicate. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:222`, `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:226`, `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:347`, `viz/src/snapshots.ts:73`
+
+**Should-Fix**
+- Off-stride recording ends are undefined. Scenario ticks need not divide by `bakeEveryTicks`; either the tail is silently lost or an irregular final frame violates the fixed-stride chunk/seek arithmetic. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:195`, `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:215`, `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:319`, `engine/scenario/scenario.go:576`
+- Normalize angles explicitly into `[0, 2π)` before flooring. Go’s `math.Mod` preserves negative signs, so ordinary `atan2` headings could otherwise wrap incorrectly into `u8`. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:172`
+- `class` narrows to `u8` without the fail-loud guard specified for IDs; scenario type count is currently unbounded. Require `TypeIdx ≤ 255` or widen it. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:158`, `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:177`, `engine/scenario/scenario.go:588`
+- The shared PMTiles key omits the exporter/bake-tool implementation version or exact exported WGS84 bytes. Projection/exporter changes can therefore produce different immutable tile bytes at the same URL. `docs/kb/decisions/ADR-0023-baked-replay-pipeline.md:460`
+
+REVIEW-COMPLETE
